SUMMARY:Wednesday night Market in Santa Rosa feat Duran Duran tribute
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma-Marin Brat Pack\nWhether your new to the group or been 
 hanging out for a while\, its always fun to make new friends. Join in as w
 e explore the largest street festival in Sonoma County going strong since 
 1989! Historic Old Courthouse Square is lined with Craft and Food Artisans
  with bakeries\, teas\, hummus\, chocolates\, kettle corn\, fresh ice crea
 m\, and fresh-squeezed lemonade\, craft beers\, wine\, food trucks\, jewel
 ry\, vintage clothing and everything else you're looking for in a summer n
 ight!\n\nTonight's free music will feature Duran Duran tribute band\, New 
 Moon Monday. Market starts at 5pm and music starts at 6pm. I will post wha
 t I'm wearing on night of event under comments as well as specific locatio
 n so I'll be easy to find.
