DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T081500
SUMMARY:Simple Sitting Meditation
DESCRIPTION:The Mindful Stream (CA)\nIn these sessions\, I will be doing g
 uided meditations where we simply sit and notice what arises.\n\nThere is 
 no agenda and no plan for how these sessions unfold. I might start off sim
 ply by asking us to notice what is already present. By becoming aware of w
 hat’s going on in our heads and in our body.\n\nThen\, the meditation ma
 y take on a life of its own.\n\nOur job is to simply be present to what ar
 ises. We may notice the mind moving and chattering about. Or we may notice
  that it’s completely silent.\n\nThe goal here\, if there is one\, is to
  simply let ourselves be as we are.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/themindfulstreamca/events/315133786/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260606T151712Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260606T151712Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
