X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_meetup_group_ohazunav
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Petaluma Social
UID:event_315229409@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260616T044902Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T092700
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T153300
SUMMARY:Angel Island Hike | 6 miles  (Leave on Tiburon Ferry at 10:00)
DESCRIPTION:Mindfull Hikes\nThis hike is for members who have attended two
  or more hikes in the last three months and buy a ferry ticket. Everyone w
 ill start off on the waitlist. ***When you buy your ticket let me know and
  I'll move you to 'going'.*** Group size is limited to 10.\n\n***Please be
  in good enough shape to hike at a moderate/fast steady pace (+/-2.5 mph) 
 and comfortable with elevation changes.***\n\n**Distance:** +/- 6.2 miles 
 total\n**The hike:** Venturing out from our usual hiking places to have a 
 little fun. A loop hike along north ridge trail\, ida trail\, fire road an
 d sunset trail. Exquisite views along the way from multiple perspectives.\
 n\nWe'll take the 10:00 AM ferry from Tiburon to Angel Island\, hike and r
 eturn on the 2:20 or 3:20 PM ferry from Angel Island to Tiburon.\n\n**Wher
 e to Meet:** Caffè Acri in Tiburon at 9:27 AM\n\n**Link to buy your ferry
  ticket:** https://angelislandferry.com/schedule/\n\n**What to bring:** Lu
 nch\, water\, hat\, good hiking shoes\, a joyful spirit and laughter. Plea
 se dress appropriately for the weather that day. Layers of clothing are al
 ways advisable.\n**===================================**\n**Reminders:**\n
 Mindful hikes are intended to be a way to connect more fully with ourselve
 s\, each other and with the land. There will be two periods of silent walk
 ing throughout the hike to allow the senses to be fully alive and felt. Th
 ere will also be time during the hike to visit and connect with each other
 . These times of talking and connecting are an invitation to bring mindful
 ness to the present moment. **It's a time to put away the cell phone and c
 ameras to disengage from technology to be fully present with each other\, 
 our *senses and the land we are inhabiting.***\n\n**Dāna**\nIn the spirit
  of the Buddhist tradition mindful hikes are offered as a dāna based even
 t. Rick Hansen says “generosity is a beautiful practice that opens and g
 laddens the heart\, relaxes the contraction of ‘self’ and ripples out 
 into the world to touch many people.” The dāna practice is **heart cent
 ered** and in the spirit of generosity. Venmo or cash is graciously accept
 ed. Venmo account is: @vickieix8\; last four digits 4714 of my phone # if 
 asked.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meetup-group-ohazunav/events/31522940
 9/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260612T142040Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260612T142040Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
