SUMMARY:Awaken Yoga @ Keller Street Cowork
DESCRIPTION:Nourish 108 Ayurveda & Yoga\nJoin me for 60 minutes of nourish
 ing morning yoga in the beautiful open space at Keller Street Cowork. Whil
 e I am here to offer a sequence of poses\, this practice is yours to give 
 your mind and body what it needs. Please bring your own yoga mat and any p
 rops you may need (strap\, block\, bolster\, blanket) and arrive a few min
 utes early to get situated. I have extra mats if you need.\n\nAll levels w
 elcome!\n\nDrop in is $18\, class passes available\, first class FREE for 
 KCW members. Sign up through the calendar at [www.nourish108.com/classes](
 www.nourish108.com/classes). Pay by credit/debit in advance or cash/Venmo 
 on-site.\n\nI look forward to seeing you on your mat!
