CREATED:20260210T163808Z
DESCRIPTION:https://www.brooksnotewinery.com/product/2026-sunset-wine-dinne
 r-at-panther-ridge-vineyard\n\nPANTHER RIDGE VINEYARD DINNERFEATURING PANTH
 ER RIDGE\, JOSEPH JEWELL & BROOKS NOTEFriday\, July 31st at 6 PMJoin us at 
 the beautiful Panther Ridge Vineyard for a scenic dinner and wine pairing w
 ith vineyard owner Suzanne Farver\, Joseph Jewell winemaker Adrian Manspeak
 er\, and Brooks Note Winemaker Garry Brooks. We will begin the evening with
  passed appetizers\, wine tasting\, and a casual social hour as we enjoy vi
 ews of Panther Ridge Vineyard from Suzanne's hillside residence. Following 
 a sunset walk through the vines\, dinner will include four courses paired w
 ith Panther Ridge\, Joseph Jewell\, and Brooks Note wines.This will be a fa
 ntastic evening of community as we bring these three great wineries togethe
 r\, all sharing the Panther Ridge Vineyard as a source of organically farme
 d Pinot Noir. Get to know this incredible site with its picturesque views\,
  art and stunning architecture\, while sampling a range of wines from each 
 brand.  \n\n This year’s dinner will be one to remember! We are excited to 
 see you then!Club Members of Panther Ridge\, Joseph Jewell\, or Brooks Note
 :Your membership receives a $50/guest discount applied at checkout.  For Jo
 seph Jewell\, Panther Ridge and Brooks Note members\, please use the discou
 nt code given to you\, or contact Brooks Note to get your code. \n\nIf you 
 need assistance or have questions\, please email info@BrooksNoteWines.com o
 r call the tasting room at (707) 981-8470 and our team will assist you.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260516T005227Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Sunset Dinner at Panther Ridge Vineyard W/Brooks Note\, Joseph Jewe
 ll\, and Panther Ridge
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
