SUMMARY:Shakespeare in the Park(ing Lot) - Caesar
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma-Marin Brat Pack\nI went to a couple of these last year 
 and they were great\, and FREE! I'm sure this will be another fun\, humoro
 us\, high energy performance.\n\nShakespeare in the Park(ing Lot) returns 
 for its fourth season with a fast\, modern-dress Julius Caesar\, performed
  in under 100 minutes and touring across Sonoma County.\n\nShakespeare’s
  great political thriller comes to life in a stripped-down\, immediate pro
 duction about ambition\, loyalty\, public power\, and the cost of betrayal
 .\n\nSeats are limited at each venue\, so we encourage you to reserve earl
 y.\n\nTickets are free and go fast so register ASAP to guarantee a spot.\n
 \n[www.jacobethan.org](www.jacobethan.org)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-marin-brat-pack/events/3151714
 86/
